 "media": [
  {
   "mediaId": "1-5-intro-video",
   "kind": "video",
   "runtimePath": "lessons/1-5/media/1-5-intro-video.mp4",
   "sha256": "01c0bcee9b7cff6e77aa607eb68ad8aba0198fca134d38c3d0690cc2284c9ea5",
   "durationSeconds": 267.946667,
   "transcriptSource": "videos-project:lesson-1-5/assets/audio/captions.generated.ts",
   "narrationDurationSeconds": 245.9,
   "offsetSeconds": 10.0,
   "expectedDurationSeconds": 267.9,
   "offsetVerified": true,
   "offsetStatus": "verified",
   "cueCount": 63,
   "segments": [
    {
     "index": 0,
     "startSeconds": 10.4,
     "endSeconds": 21.13,
     "textPreview": "大家好，欢迎来到闲聊自控。今天只看一个动作：把增益 K 慢慢拧大。同一艘船、同一",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 1,
     "startSeconds": 21.13,
     "endSeconds": 35.11,
     "textPreview": "有人说增益越大越快，这话只对了一半。快的是起步，慢的是收敛。我们把极点、阶跃响应",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-a30f001ebd5a123a456a51da",
       "matchedLabel": "阶跃响应",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 4,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 2,
     "startSeconds": 37.4,
     "endSeconds": 46.65,
     "textPreview": "先看对象：一个三阶无零点系统。它串着一个积分环节和两个惯性环节。比例增益 K 与",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 3,
     "startSeconds": 47.37,
     "endSeconds": 55.51,
     "textPreview": "闭环特征方程是 s 立方加七 s 平方加六 s 加 K。K 就藏在常数项里。",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:v11g-40ac1517fc1bfb398dd75afe",
       "matchedLabel": "特征方程",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 8,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 4,
     "startSeconds": 55.51,
     "endSeconds": 66.44,
     "textPreview": "增益一变，极点就得重新求解。我们不随机拧，把增益分成四个区段。低增益、中增益、高",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 5,
     "startSeconds": 66.44,
     "endSeconds": 78.14,
     "textPreview": "临界增益恰好等于四十二，记住这个数。现在把三张图摆上台：左边复平面，中间时域，右",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 6,
     "startSeconds": 78.14,
     "endSeconds": 88.71,
     "textPreview": "它们共用同一个 K，一个动，三个一起动。先看 K 等于三。主导极点在负零点四五附",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-object-23ce934816d236fcc2836d27",
       "matchedLabel": "主导极点",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 8,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 7,
     "startSeconds": 88.71,
     "endSeconds": 97.44,
     "textPreview": "阶跃响应只有约百分之七的超调量，七点四秒收稳。伯德图上相位裕度六十一度，余量充足",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:m3-v1i:canonical-object:44ba9f502d62725bda3f150c",
       "matchedLabel": "相位裕度",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      },
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-a30f001ebd5a123a456a51da",
       "matchedLabel": "阶跃响应",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 4,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 8,
     "startSeconds": 97.44,
     "endSeconds": 107.67,
     "textPreview": "三张图说的是同一句话：离稳定边界还很远。把 K 推到十二。极点向右上方爬，虚部变",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 9,
     "startSeconds": 107.67,
     "endSeconds": 116.24,
     "textPreview": "超调量冲到约百分之四十六，摆动明显。但注意，上升时间从两点八秒缩到零点九秒。",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-a9f8ff29f0e4550a22bfcc67",
       "matchedLabel": "上升时间",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 10,
     "startSeconds": 116.24,
     "endSeconds": 126.85,
     "textPreview": "起步确实更快了，这一点不假。可是调节时间反而从七点四秒拖到八秒。相位裕度从六十一",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:m3-v1i:canonical-object:44ba9f502d62725bda3f150c",
       "matchedLabel": "相位裕度",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      },
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-9cd2a9dfb0f7f3d457247609",
       "matchedLabel": "调节时间",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 11,
     "startSeconds": 126.85,
     "endSeconds": 137.63,
     "textPreview": "第一次分裂出现了：起步的快，换不来收敛的快。继续拧。K 二十四，极点几乎贴上虚轴",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 12,
     "startSeconds": 138.13,
     "endSeconds": 150.26,
     "textPreview": "超调七成，调节时间十五秒半。相位裕度只剩十二度。K 三十六，已经在边界门口。超调",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:m3-v1i:canonical-object:44ba9f502d62725bda3f150c",
       "matchedLabel": "相位裕度",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      },
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-9cd2a9dfb0f7f3d457247609",
       "matchedLabel": "调节时间",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 13,
     "startSeconds": 150.26,
     "endSeconds": 158.54,
     "textPreview": "调节时间五十二秒，相位裕度只剩三度。对比 K 十二：上升时间又缩短了一半。",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:m3-v1i:canonical-object:44ba9f502d62725bda3f150c",
       "matchedLabel": "相位裕度",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      },
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-9cd2a9dfb0f7f3d457247609",
       "matchedLabel": "调节时间",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      },
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-a9f8ff29f0e4550a22bfcc67",
       "matchedLabel": "上升时间",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 14,
     "startSeconds": 158.54,
     "endSeconds": 168.48,
     "textPreview": "但你愿意为这零点四秒，付出四十秒的收敛吗？这就是增益的回报递减。机械上你也见过这",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 15,
     "startSeconds": 168.48,
     "endSeconds": 181.7,
     "textPreview": "阻尼越弱，振荡拖得越久，直到再也收不住。把 s 等于 j 欧米伽代入特征方程，实",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:v11g-40ac1517fc1bfb398dd75afe",
       "matchedLabel": "特征方程",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 8,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 16,
     "startSeconds": 182.2,
     "endSeconds": 192.64,
     "textPreview": "K 等于四十二，极点正好落在虚轴上。阶跃响应不收不放，长期等幅振荡。增益穿越和相",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-a30f001ebd5a123a456a51da",
       "matchedLabel": "阶跃响应",
       "labelKind": "alias",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 4,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 17,
     "startSeconds": 192.64,
     "endSeconds": 203.16,
     "textPreview": "三个域在临界点上判决完全一致。再越过一步，K 大于四十二。共轭极点进入右半平面，",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 18,
     "startSeconds": 203.16,
     "endSeconds": 212.95,
     "textPreview": "任何只在一张图上成立的临界，都不算数。把五个代表增益摆进同一张对照表。",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 19,
     "startSeconds": 213.45,
     "endSeconds": 223.36,
     "textPreview": "主线一：快这个字，至少有三种意思。上升时间管第一次到达，调节时间管安稳留下。增益",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-9cd2a9dfb0f7f3d457247609",
       "matchedLabel": "调节时间",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      },
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-a9f8ff29f0e4550a22bfcc67",
       "matchedLabel": "上升时间",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      },
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-object-7761615701fb4915a76924ff",
       "matchedLabel": "穿越频率",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 20,
     "startSeconds": 223.36,
     "endSeconds": 235.46,
     "textPreview": "K 从三到十二，一个缩短一个延长，方向相反。主线二：三个域的结论必须相容。指标不",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 21,
     "startSeconds": 235.46,
     "endSeconds": 244.44,
     "textPreview": "稳定与否，只看闭环极点或等价判据。一个增益，三张图，一条证据链。",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-47a2e3c44742b45c55ac902d",
       "matchedLabel": "闭环极点",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "caption-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 22,
     "startSeconds": 244.44,
     "endSeconds": 253.91,
     "textPreview": "极点到位、响应成型、裕度落定，同时成立。下次增益怎么调都不满意，还能动什么？我们",
     "canonical": []
